[{"title":"拟登金陵凤凰台","author":"王恭","text":"高台犹有凤凰名，台下金河绕帝庭。\n淮水漫流千古恨，钟山还带六朝青。\n风樯积雨丹阳渡，酒幔寒花白下亭。\n欲把一杯招李白，海天霜雁晚冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟游君山寺","author":"王恭","text":"独向巴陵上小舟，君山迢递镜中浮。\n猿啼古木云边迥，鸟度灵花象外幽。\n烟磬夜寒云梦月，天香朝泛洞庭秋。\n更随野衲看灵异，惆怅皇英墓下游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋过紫云洞","author":"王恭","text":"仙源迢递紫云间，逸兴逢秋偶独攀。\n辽海鹤归空夜月，瑶台人去但荒山。\n苔边积水流天镜，鸟外遥峰点翠鬟。\n石竹房中孤磬晚，此身那似野僧闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吴汉津远游卷","author":"王恭","text":"独衔君命出神州，吴楚青山马上游。\n千里关河分禹贡，百城烟水入闽秋。\n镜湖乡梦浮仙棹，钟阜归期忆凤楼。\n闻道星轺明且别，王程犹恐久淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘炷归菊潭","author":"王恭","text":"春深花里未成欢，何事秋深惜别难。\n沙堰醒来枫叶变，江潭归去菊花寒。\n鱼风卷幔鸣琴坐，蚌月临窗对酒看。\n此后相思应不远，也须双鲤报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜潘元润至","author":"王恭","text":"金沙堤上见潘安，自愧林居尚鹖冠。\n明月青山应久别，黄花绿酒又同欢。\n空洲日暮孤鸿断，岐路霜飞远树寒。\n明到龙江重回首，别离浑是梦中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沧洲野堂卷 其一","author":"王恭","text":"白沙门外水粼粼，懒漫还宜漉酒巾。\n华发任随风叶冷，远心惟与海鸥驯。\n秋经泉石偏多梦，老向丘园有几人。\n闻道壶觞仍爱客，风流能待布衣贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沧洲野堂卷 其二","author":"王恭","text":"大堤深树绕高原，渔榜蒹葭接远村。\n江上只留三亩宅，人间不记五侯门。\n青林白鸟闲书幌，细雨飞花送酒樽。\n?得相逢乘一醉，故园山水也忘言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二乔图","author":"王恭","text":"双娥娇掩为谁颦，反被荣华误却身。\n回首东吴何事业，野烟寒水更愁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马图","author":"王恭","text":"淮泗云空苜蓿齐，圉人牵出踏青泥。\n金舆不恋西池赏，虚负天寒十二蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种黄精","author":"王恭","text":"手种黄精只半畦，草根时见叶初齐。\n不知门外残春雨，多少飞花踏作泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海市晴云图","author":"王恭","text":"燕蓟云山王气收，行人犹自问登舟。\n秪今海子桥西月，独照湾河水尚流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水扇面 其一","author":"王恭","text":"茅舍青山少四邻，萧条苔径绝红尘。\n相逢试问山中事，老向林泉有几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水扇面 其二","author":"王恭","text":"鸟外垂阳覆石矶，隔江晴翠晒行衣。\n苍苔野径柴门尽，相对云山共息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水扇面 其三","author":"王恭","text":"夕阳溪上掩荆关，渔浦风村杳霭间。\n莫学林僧解忘世，有钱莫买沃州山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山欲雨图","author":"王恭","text":"寂历青山静赏机，野情那似宦情微。\n抱琴欲渡湘江去，云暗苍梧雨欲飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韩信报金漂母","author":"王恭","text":"恩沾一饭尚知酬，义重纲常岂负刘。\n惆怅淮阴何事业，断烟寒草不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古木山禽图","author":"王恭","text":"梁王池苑罢经过，古木残云奈尔何。\n莫放流音空袅袅，行人长少夕阳多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪滩鸂?","author":"王恭","text":"北风吹雪渡河关，家近潇湘梦亦闲。\n犹胜寒环旧时雀，孤飞正在纥干山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋水鸳鸯","author":"王恭","text":"宫瓦凌秋飞早霜，绣衾遥夜度馀香。\n自然影落空潭水，不管人间更断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双美人吹箫","author":"王恭","text":"黛娥双染为谁娇，长信深沉夜品箫。\n一曲梁州相倚恨，露花如水上芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫人春思图","author":"王恭","text":"君恩那似柳条轻，门外金舆暗度声。\n独立长门春又晚，一帘闲草上阶生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早寒","author":"王恭","text":"客舍迎寒独未归，白云乡树远依依。\n西风黄叶如相识，故向山阳笛里飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之蓟丘","author":"王恭","text":"怜君迢递蓟门行，匹马闲嘶问去程。\n泸水燕山何日到，秋风吹雨湿金茎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"台城送客之广陵城","author":"王恭","text":"金陵树里送行舟，二十四桥春水流。\n肠断琼花天上去，更无歌管下扬州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆山中精舍","author":"王恭","text":"一从巾舄别林扃，清梵香台梦里经。\n遥想秋来风露冷，芭蕉抽叶几回青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35514,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄越城知己","author":"王恭","text":"郡楼寒夜响悲笳，梦里还乡路益赊。\n莫道故人消息近，越王潭水即长沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓意","author":"王恭","text":"南苑花红北苑稀，美人楼上泣罗衣。\n同时种树应皆落，何事秋风却后飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中夜雨","author":"王恭","text":"孤阁悬灯暗复明，满林凉雨落秋声。\n别来多少湘江水，尽向苍梧叶上倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35517,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨菊兰 其一","author":"王恭","text":"霜落枫林秋气高，霜黄烟翠积湘皋。\n青林酒醒西风急，剩写离情寄楚骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35518,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经怀安有感","author":"王恭","text":"岊河江水古今流，送尽年光与客愁。\n莫叹寒门空草色，五陵佳气散成秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35519,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水墨蒲萄","author":"王恭","text":"西塞秋风寒露飞，草龙珠帐正依依。\n不知五马缘何事，转羡凉州一斗微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题猿图","author":"王恭","text":"西风残叶响秋江，树抄青猿挂影双。\n因忆孤舟经峡口，数声随雨落篷窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景山水","author":"王恭","text":"云山迢递树苍苍，春水微茫带野航。\n欲傍渔郎深隐去，武陵虽好是他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口占寄友","author":"王恭","text":"青草平湖白鹭飞，石门烟树半晴晖。\n菊潭对酒闲垂愰，谁向筹峰共采薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彦魁题梅","author":"王恭","text":"霜花映水夜含虚，画角声中片月孤。\n一自罗浮清梦觉，又随香影到西湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明老题梅","author":"王恭","text":"东阁高人不见寻，孤芳只合老山林。\n知心尚有青天月，照见岁寒冰雪心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35525,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野航风雨","author":"王恭","text":"枫树萧萧野水西，楚天云雨正凄凄。\n沧江欲暮风犹急，谁泛扁舟更出溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35526,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白莲图为鄱阳戴处警赋","author":"王恭","text":"素袜凌波绿锦裳，参差环佩夜微凉。\n青芬已在瑶池上，况是承恩雨露香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35527,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书云山小景","author":"王恭","text":"野杖闲行日未曛，商歌休使世人闻。\n生平最是知心者，秪有青山共白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35528,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡人牧马图","author":"王恭","text":"海子桥边卸马鞍，燕山秋草色漫漫。\n百年王气和烟散，往事空从画里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35529,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春雨中作","author":"王恭","text":"帘前花落杜鹃鸣，棕叶萧萧半雨声。\n迢递故园归未得，天涯芳草揔关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35530,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登凤凰山仙人梯","author":"王恭","text":"鹤山吹笙去不还，空留梯石白云间。\n尘凡自愧无仙骨，独对岩扉试一攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35531,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道边松","author":"王恭","text":"驿畔长松几百秋，行人到此也生愁。\n最怜每被官军斫，满地寒胶作泪流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35532,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟游天台山","author":"王恭","text":"赤城霞气映层标，华顶遥临见石桥。\n更到谢公登览处，泉声山影晚萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归蜀 其一","author":"王恭","text":"蜀栈凌云不见行，剑门烟树最关情。\n君家正在鱼凫国，出尽平川是锦城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归蜀 其二","author":"王恭","text":"剑门西望蜀江流，白帝城边叶未秋。\n归到山林何事业，木棉花发杜鹃愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵清话","author":"王恭","text":"樵歌日日出林扉，赢得身闲坐钓矶。\n莫向相逢笑贫薄，人生此乐也应稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摘兰","author":"王恭","text":"寂寞深林野水滨，可怜开落不逢人。\n知音更有谁堪赠，持与湘南放逐臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜舟中","author":"王恭","text":"碧潭遥夜小孤舟，凉月清风揔是秋。\n何事故人千里外，江枫渔火共关愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋江待渡扇面","author":"王恭","text":"孤庭枫树暮江头，何事匆匆逐去舟。\n莫向瞿塘滩下过，两崖明月断?愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山楼晚坐有怀同志","author":"王恭","text":"绿萝烟暝夕阳收，何处?啼更倚楼。\n京国故人分别久，楚云湘水共关愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄独夜","author":"王恭","text":"草屋残灯夜转深，竹边萤火照孤吟。\n青山历历?啼断，储叶萧萧月满林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远浦归帆","author":"王恭","text":"远浦归舟鸟外还，棹歌迢递过前滩。\n丹枫树里帆初落，多少青山夕照间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35542,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋山暮归 其一","author":"王恭","text":"桄榔枝上夕阳微，寂历秋风吹葛衣。\n回首前溪灯火起，阴虫声里扣荆扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35543,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋山暮归 其二","author":"王恭","text":"白云迢递乱峰深，谷口斜晖转树林。\n归到茅斋灯火夕，不堪黄叶与秋砧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35544,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游皇恩寺","author":"王恭","text":"莲宇经台花正香，白云深映竹边房。\n清游惜共林僧别，行听微钟到学堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35545,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江送客","author":"王恭","text":"江亭春树晓苍苍，树里莺啼也断肠。\n三叠阳关须尽醉，东城门外是他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35546,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居即事","author":"王恭","text":"门掩青峰野水间，绿萝花暝鸟飞还。\n纷纷车马红尘里，何似仙家半日闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35547,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古镜","author":"王恭","text":"匣里菱花重百金，重重磨洗畏尘侵。\n六宫只辨媸妍色，不照孤臣一片心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35548,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人从军永宁","author":"王恭","text":"忍泪含凄别四邻，温陵南去柳条新。\n殷勤试问边城卒，年少封侯有几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35549,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采桑","author":"王恭","text":"玉腕罗裙陌上桑，南枝袅袅北枝长。\n殷勤为谢青云客，莫把黄金买路傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35550,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄山中人","author":"王恭","text":"佳君住处在深山，高卧林扉日日闲。\n借问松间双白鹤，何时相问到人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35551,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春田家","author":"王恭","text":"鹁鸠低傍野田飞，布谷声中半掩扉。\n不愿五陵衣马贵，但令州县往来稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35552,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜投山馆","author":"王恭","text":"野馆残灯暗复明，子规声里客愁生。\n绿萝洞口三更月，何限乡山万里情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35553,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨","author":"王恭","text":"中酒空斋醉不眠，萧萧鸣雨暮春天。\n自怜叶叶芭蕉里，拟是吴山半夜船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35554,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归觐","author":"王恭","text":"天涯长望白云飞，此日怜君暂得归。\n好是乡园春雨后，落花风里舞斑衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35555,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春雨中作","author":"王恭","text":"湘帘卷尽思悠悠，目断遥天雨未收。\n莫道故园无别恨，落花流水也关愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35556,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送屿南林虚白归","author":"王恭","text":"情深那忍送君还，海屿南隅雨未乾。\n归见渭阳如借问，为言孙子寄平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35557,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅城晓角 其一","author":"王恭","text":"玉壶淋尽报残更，呜咽营门几度声。\n明发不堪回首处，梅花零落满江城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35558,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅城晓角 其二","author":"王恭","text":"城乌啼断海东头，三弄梅花起戍楼。\n谁向营门看月色，声声都是别离愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35559,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮酒言怀","author":"王恭","text":"竹亭花径小阑干，绿酒新诗且共欢。\n浮世相逢须尽醉，青云都向命中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35560,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后登南楼","author":"王恭","text":"雨过晴楼独上迟，海云江树远含滋。\n繁华尽逐东流水，惟有前山似昔时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折荼蘼","author":"王恭","text":"手挽长条刺拂衣，淡黄疏白共芳菲。\n五陵年少无拘系，落尽残香未肯归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠释子赴阙","author":"王恭","text":"远随飞锡过闽关，迢递吴山共楚山。\n遥想禁墀清梵晓，泠泠钟磬五云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王昭君","author":"王恭","text":"行辞女伴出深宫，玉泪双垂向白龙。\n几度毡庐歌酒夜，胡王空惜旧时宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家夜雨","author":"王恭","text":"山雨潇潇静掩门，绩灯影里戏儿孙。\n棕榈叶上声声好，不似天涯断客魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经山中旧宅","author":"王恭","text":"柴门空掩树阴阴，积雨荒苔路更深。\n自是尘中那久往，白云流水更关心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月东湖泛舟","author":"王恭","text":"荇花风袅断烟微，共看兰舟汎夕晖。\n篷下美人歌白苧，绿荷深里白鸥飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]